movie night popcorn
- 1/2 cup kernels, 3 tbsp oil, big pot with a lid
- put 3 kernels in the oil first; when they pop, the oil is ready
- add the rest, shake, lid slightly open for steam
- off the heat when popping slows to 2-3 seconds between pops
- butter + salt, or caramel for Zara
unpopped kernels at the bottom = old corn, buy fresh
